`--depth` applies to the glob view only, so combining it with `--debug` is a usage error with exit 2.
== args
--debug
--depth
1
input
== file input/a.md
# a
== stdout
== stderr
error: the argument '--debug' cannot be used with '--depth <N>'

Usage: outln --debug <PATH>...

For more information, try '--help'.
== exit 2
